[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0001","text":"偶像1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0010","text":"——诶！？有那么厉害吗！？\n成员之间默契很好的组合啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0011","text":"偶像2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0020","text":"对呀！本来就是我超喜欢的两个人！\n新MV简直绝了——！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0030","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0040","text":"闭嘴……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0050","text":"——路加，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0070","text":"快到出场时间了，准备一下，拜托了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0080","text":"喂、喂。\n路加，你要去哪儿……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0090","text":"没必要跟你说。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22600900_01_0100","text":"（……\n　路加的话，一定会回来的吧……）"}]
